From f9241bc7d282a55c949219e68691b87d56a4282b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:02:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove Pro subscription; unlock every feature for everyone

- Twin AI: BOTH tab opens directly. Delete the Go Pro gate (ProGateSheet,
  ProGateViewModel, ProModels incl. UPI payment details) and drop the Pro
  status / upgrade-request API, DTOs and repository methods.
- Memory Globe: "Pin a Memory" opens the form directly. Remove the Pro
  check, the checkingPro state/spinner, and the Pro API/DTO/repository.
- Remove the twinai_pro_* and globe_toast_pro* strings.
- Tests: replace the Globe "not Pro" / "Pro" pin tests with a single
  "pin opens form" test; drop the Pro upgrade-form mapper test.
- Docs: remove statements about the Pro gate.
